  "body": "When `dest.write()` puts `dest` into errored state synchronously (i.e. `[[error]]` is called during `[[onWrite]]` call or `[[onWrite]]` throws), the `fillDest()` call next to `dest.write()` will call `cancelSource()` without any argument. Maybe we want to pass the reason to the source as well as the other cases (`dest.wait()` call case, `dest.write()` call but catch-ed case).\n",
